OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder arrest after     
OL,4,Acouncillor stabbed                     
OL,6,FA councillor has been seriously injured
OL,7,Fafter being stabbed while undertaking  
OL,8,Fhis duties in Bradford.                
OL,10,FBradford Moor councillor Ibrar Ali was 
OL,11,Fattacked at about 11:04 GMT on Manse   
OL,12,FStreet, according to the deputy leader 
OL,13,Fof Your Bradford Independent Group,    
OL,14,Fcouncillor Ishtiaq Ahmed.              
OL,16,FWest Yorkshire Police said a           
OL,17,F32-year-old man had been arrested on   
OL,18,Fsuspicion of attempted murder and was  
OL,19,Fbeing held in custody.                 
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
